      "message": "Thank you Jared. This is an interesting case. My current understanding is `wear-service` is not like these `*-service` in mainline module, it kind of an extension of `services` for wear, in the non-updatable part? so based on the go/android-flag-containers, both `wear-container` and `services` belong to `system`. the go/repackage_flags actually is for exportable flags (yea, I think should rename it), and in this case since both of them belong to the same container, the same repackage rule will be applied..\n\nSeems like this would be a common issue for building module explicitly depends on `services`",
